 "rules": [
  {
   "name": "ap_decode",
   "comment": "RUNG 1, THE CROSS-FIELD SCAN: a pending AnalogyProbe finds its best structural PARTNER among the target field(s) \u2014 Argmax over the scoped ConceptShape parts of FixedCount(AntiUnify(source.sig, part.sig)), the DERIVED shared-structure specificity. This is the scan that used to be a Python triple-nested loop (SHAPE_AUDIT.md \u00a72.4), now a graph verdict over WHATEVER structure the concept signature carries \u2014 relational edges when the concept has them, attrs + vocabulary axes otherwise. 'Arbitrary shapes across fields', not a five-order string-token dial. covered_by is the best partner's field::name; best_count is its shared-structure count (the positive-evidence guard). The candidate set is scoped by In(part.name, obs.scope) to the target field(s) minus the probe's own part \u2014 cross-field and no-self by construction.",
   "match_type": "AnalogyProbe",
   "match": [
    [
     "ag",
     "observed_probe",
     "obs"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "Eq",
    "a": {
     "type": "Attr",
     "node": {
      "type": "Var",
      "name": "obs"
     },
     "key": "status"
    },
    "b": {
     "type": "Lit",
     "value": "pending"
    }
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "set_attr",
     "obs",
     "covered_by",
     {
      "__term__": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "key": "name",
       "node": {
        "type": "Argmax",
        "source": {
         "type": "Filter",
         "source": {
          "type": "NodesOfType",
          "node_type": "ConceptShape"
         },
         "var_name": "mt",
         "predicate": {
          "type": "In",
          "member": {
           "type": "Attr",
           "node": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "mt"
           },
           "key": "name"
          },
          "container": {
           "type": "Attr",
           "node": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "obs"
           },
           "key": "scope"
          }
         }
        },
        "var_name": "mt",
        "value": {
         "type": "FixedCount",
         "pattern": {
          "type": "AntiUnify",
          "values": {
           "type": "SetT",
           "items": [
            {
             "type": "Attr",
             "node": {
              "type": "Var",
              "name": "obs"
             },
             "key": "signature"
            },
            {
             "type": "Attr",
             "node": {
              "type": "Var",
              "name": "mt"
             },
             "key": "signature"
            }
           ]
          }
         },
         "wild": "\u00b7?\u00b7"
        },
        "default": null
       }
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     "set_attr",
     "obs",
     "best_count",
     {
      "__term__": {
       "type": "FixedCount",
       "pattern": {
        "type": "AntiUnify",
