  {
   "name": "ap_emit",
   "comment": "THE VERDICT. An aligned probe (structurally aligned OR corroborated by the parallelogram) becomes an Analogy node carrying the source and matched target concepts, the DERIVED struct_shared and corroboration, and an `implements` edge asserting the structural correspondence \u2014 written ONLY here, ONLY when structure was actually computed and positive (contrast SHAPE_AUDIT.md \u00a72.4's hand-set `order_n >= 2` ordinal). Mint-once guarded by the already-emitted edge.",
